 *		fixed wrapping to account for tabs & ANSI strings
 *		split screen for ansi terminals
 *
 *	Jenna 2001/04/18
 *		changed 'prompt's to query_prompt()s
 *
 *	Dodinas 2001/04/18
 *		Following Jenna's change, prompts now replace a few 
 *		variables with integers (like current hp etc)
 *
 *	Dodinas 2001/04/19
 *		Query_prompt changed back to return prompt, Display_prompt
